// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Graph Labels & Edge Types for PPTX OOXML → kagami mapping
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Nodes: Presentation, Slide, Shape, TextBody, Paragraph, Run, Image, Theme, SlideMaster, SlideLayout
